        "market_blurb": "Elgin, Illinois, located along the Fox River in Kane County, has a diversified economy anchored by healthcare, education, and manufacturing. The city is home to Advocate Sherman Hospital and the Grand Victoria Casino, two of its largest employers, alongside a strong public sector presence through School District U-46 and local government. Elgin's industrial base, including manufacturers like Elgin Sweeper Company and Koch Foods, continues to support its working-class economic identity within the greater Chicago metro area.",
